":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Espaçamento"}],"items":[{"name":"--space-1","value":"4px"},{"name":"--space-2","value":"8px"},{"name":"--space-3","value":"12px"},{"name":"--space-4","value":"16px"},{"name":"--space-5","value":"20px"},{"name":"--space-6","value":"24px"},{"name":"--space-8","value":"32px"},{"name":"--space-12","value":"48px"},{"name":"--section-y-desktop","value":"88px"},{"name":"--section-y-tablet","value":"64px"},{"name":"--section-y-phone","value":"44px"}]},{"group":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Raio"}],"items":[{"name":"--radius-sm","value":"8px"},{"name":"--radius-md","value":"12px"},{"name":"--radius-lg","value":"18px"},{"name":"--radius-pill","value":"9999px"}]},{"group":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Elevação"}],"items":[{"name":"--elev-flat","value":"none"},{"name":"--elev-ring","value":"0 0 0 1px var(--border)"},{"name":"--elev-raised","value":"0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42)"}]},{"group":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Foco"}],"items":[{"name":"--focus-ring","value":"0 0 0 4px rgba(113, 50, 245, 0.32)"}]},{"group":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Movimento"}],"items":[{"name":"--motion-fast","value":"120ms"},{"name":"--motion-base","value":"200ms"},{"name":"--ease-standard","value":"cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1)"}]},{"group":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Layout"}],"items":[{"name":"--container-max","value":"1280px"},{"name":"--container-gutter-desktop","value":"32px"},{"name":"--container-gutter-tablet","value":"24px"},{"name":"--container-gutter-phone","value":"16px"}]}],"vars":{"color-scheme":"dark","--primary-500":"#9497a9","--primary-500-fg":"#111111","--neutral-400":"#aaabac","--neutral-400-fg":"#111111","--ok-ink":"var(--ok)","--ok-fg":"#111111","--warn-ink":"var(--warn)","--warn-fg":"#111111","--danger-ink":"var(--danger)","--danger-fg":"#111111","--fs-xs":"0.6875rem","--fs-sm":"0.8125rem","--fs-base":"0.9375rem","--fs-h3":"1.375rem","--fs-h2":"1.875rem","--fs-h1":"2.75rem","--fs-hero":"3.75rem","--lh-body":"1.48","--lh-tight":"1.08","--display-tracking":"-0.015em","--section-y":"88px","--section-y-tablet":"64px","--container-max":"1280px","--gutter":"32px","--gutter-tablet":"24px","--gutter-phone":"16px","--motion-fast":"120ms","--motion-base":"200ms","--ease":"cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1)","--radius-lg":"18px","--focus-ring":"0 0 0 4px rgba(113, 50, 245, 0.32)","--h3-weight":"700","--body-weight":"400","--btn-weight":"600","--btn-radius":"12px","--btn-pad-y":"13px","--btn-pad-x":"16px","--bg":"#0b1020","--surface":"#121a33","--surface-2":"#1b2450","--fg":"#f8fafc","--fg-soft":"#cbd5e1","--muted":"#8b95aa","--meta":"color-mix(in oklab, #7d5cff 80%, var(--fg))","--border":"#26314f","--border-soft":"#1b2740","--border-strong":"color-mix(in oklab, var(--fg) 22%, transparent)","--accent":"#7132f5","--accent-strong":"color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 65%, var(--fg))","--accent-weak":"color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 12%, var(--bg))","--accent-fg":"#ffffff","--solid":"#7132f5","--solid-hover":"#612ad5","--solid-fg":"#ffffff","--ok":"#00c853","--ok-weak":"color-mix(in oklab, var(--ok) 12%, var(--bg))","--warn":"#ffb020","--warn-weak":"color-mix(in oklab, var(--warn) 14%, var(--bg))","--danger":"#ff4d6d","--danger-weak":"color-mix(in oklab, var(--danger) 12%, var(--bg))","--bw":"1px","--radius":"12px","--radius-sm":"8px","--radius-pill":"9999px","--shadow-card":"0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42)","--shadow-pop":"0 14px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22)","--font-display":"\"Kraken-Brand\", \"IBM Plex Sans\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","--font-body":"\"Kraken-Product\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","--font-code":"ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace","--font-mono":"ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace","--heading-weight":"700","--hero-ground":"var(--surface-2)","--hero-ink":"var(--fg)"},"sections":[{"id":"visual-theme-atmosphere","title":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Tema visual e atmosfera"}],"html":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"<p>O site da Kraken é uma corretora de criptomoedas limpa e confiável, que usa o roxo como cor de marca dominante. O design funciona sobre fundos brancos, com o Kraken Purple (<code>#7132f5</code>, <code>#5741d8</code>, <code>#5b1ecf</code>) criando uma identidade cripto distinta e profissional. A fonte proprietária Kraken-Brand cuida dos títulos de display com peso negrito (700) e tracking negativo, enquanto a Kraken-Product (com fallback IBM Plex Sans) é o burro de carga da interface.</p>\n<p><strong>Características principais:</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Kraken Purple (<code>#7132f5</code>) como cor principal da marca, com variantes mais escuras (<code>#5741d8</code>, <code>#5b1ecf</code>)</li><li>Sistema de duas fontes: Kraken-Brand (display) + Kraken-Product (interface)</li><li>Texto quase preto (<code>#101114</code>) com escala neutra cinza-azulada fria</li><li>Botões com raio de 12px (arredondados, mas não em pílula)</li><li>Sombras sutis (<code>rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 0px 4px 24px</code>) — quase um sussurro</li><li>Destaque verde (<code>#149e61</code>) para estados positivos/de sucesso</li></ul>"}]},{"id":"color-palette-roles","title":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Paleta de cores e papéis"}],"html":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"<h3>Primárias</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Kraken Purple</strong> (<code>#7132f5</code>): CTA principal, destaque da marca, links</li><li><strong>Purple Dark</strong> (<code>#5741d8</code>): bordas de botões, variantes com contorno</li><li><strong>Purple Deep</strong> (<code>#5b1ecf</code>): o roxo mais profundo</li><li><strong>Purple Subtle</strong> (<code>rgba(133,91,251,0.16)</code>): roxo a 16% — fundos sutis de botões</li><li><strong>Near Black</strong> (<code>#101114</code>): texto principal</li></ul>\n<h3>Neutras</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Cool Gray</strong> (<code>#686b82</code>): neutra principal, bordas a 24% de opacidade</li><li><strong>Silver Blue</strong> (<code>#9497a9</code>): texto secundário, elementos esmaecidos</li><li><strong>White</strong> (<code>#ffffff</code>): superfície principal</li><li><strong>Border Gray</strong> (<code>#dedee5</code>): bordas divisórias</li></ul>\n<h3>Semânticas</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Green</strong> (<code>#149e61</code>): sucesso/positivo a 16% de opacidade nos badges</li><li><strong>Green Dark</strong> (<code>#026b3f</code>): texto dos badges</li></ul>"}]},{"id":"typography-rules","title":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Regras de tipografia"}],"html":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"<h3>Famílias tipográficas</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Display</strong>: <code>Kraken-Brand</code>, fallbacks: <code>IBM Plex Sans, Helvetica, Arial</code></li><li><strong>Interface / corpo</strong>: <code>Kraken-Product</code>, fallbacks: <code>Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial</code></li></ul>\n<h3>Hierarquia</h3>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Papel</th><th>Fonte</th><th>Tamanho</th><th>Peso</th><th>Altura da linha</th><th>Espaçamento entre letras</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Hero</td><td>Kraken-Brand</td><td>48px</td><td>700</td><td>1.17</td><td>-1px</td></tr><tr><td>Título de seção</td><td>Kraken-Brand</td><td>36px</td><td>700</td><td>1.22</td><td>-0.5px</td></tr><tr><td>Subtítulo</td><td>Kraken-Brand</td><td>28px</td><td>700</td><td>1.29</td><td>-0.5px</td></tr><tr><td>Título de recurso</td><td>Kraken-Product</td><td>22px</td><td>600</td><td>1.20</td><td>normal</td></tr><tr><td>Corpo</td><td>Kraken-Product</td><td>16px</td><td>400</td><td>1.38</td><td>normal</td></tr><tr><td>Corpo médio</td><td>Kraken-Product</td><td>16px</td><td>500</td><td>1.38</td><td>normal</td></tr><tr><td>Botão</td><td>Kraken-Product</td><td>16px</td><td>500–600</td><td>1.38</td><td>normal</td></tr><tr><td>Legenda</td><td>Kraken-Product</td><td>14px</td><td>400–700</td><td>1.43–1.71</td><td>normal</td></tr><tr><td>Pequeno</td><td>Kraken-Product</td><td>12px</td><td>400–500</td><td>1.33</td><td>normal</td></tr><tr><td>Micro</td><td>Kraken-Product</td><td>7px</td><td>500</td><td>1.00</td><td>caixa-alta</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]},{"id":"component-stylings","title":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Estilo dos componentes"}],"html":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"<h3>Botões</h3>\n<p><strong>Roxo primário</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Fundo: <code>#7132f5</code></li><li>Texto: <code>#ffffff</code></li><li>Padding: 13px 16px</li><li>Raio: 12px</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Roxo com contorno</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Fundo: <code>#ffffff</code></li><li>Texto: <code>#5741d8</code></li><li>Borda: <code>1px solid #5741d8</code></li><li>Raio: 12px</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Roxo sutil</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Fundo: <code>rgba(133,91,251,0.16)</code></li><li>Texto: <code>#7132f5</code></li><li>Padding: 8px</li><li>Raio: 12px</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Botão branco</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Fundo: <code>#ffffff</code></li><li>Texto: <code>#101114</code></li><li>Raio: 10px</li><li>Sombra: <code>rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 0px 4px 24px</code></li></ul>\n<p><strong>Cinza secundário</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Fundo: <code>rgba(148,151,169,0.08)</code></li><li>Texto: <code>#101114</code></li><li>Raio: 12px</li></ul>\n<h3>Badges</h3>\n<ul><li>Sucesso: fundo <code>rgba(20,158,97,0.16)</code>, texto <code>#026b3f</code>, raio de 6px</li><li>Neutro: fundo <code>rgba(104,107,130,0.12)</code>, texto <code>#484b5e</code>, raio de 8px</li></ul>"}]},{"id":"layout-principles","title":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Princípios de layout"}],"html":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"<h3>Espaçamento: 1px, 2px, 3px, 4px, 5px, 6px, 8px, 10px, 12px, 13px, 15px, 16px, 20px, 24px, 25px</h3>\n<h3>Raio de borda: 3px, 6px, 8px, 10px, 12px, 16px, 9999px, 50%</h3>"}]},{"id":"depth-elevation","title":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Profundidade e elevação"}],"html":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"<ul><li>Sutil: <code>rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 0px 4px 24px</code></li><li>Micro: <code>rgba(16,24,40,0.04) 0px 1px 4px</code></li></ul>"}]},{"id":"do-s-and-don-ts","title":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"O que fazer e o que evitar"}],"html":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"<h3>Faça</h3>\n<ul><li>Use o Kraken Purple (#7132f5) em CTAs e links</li><li>Aplique raio de 12px em todos os botões</li><li>Use Kraken-Brand nos títulos e Kraken-Product no corpo</li></ul>\n<h3>Não faça</h3>\n<ul><li>Não use botões em pílula — 12px é o raio máximo dos botões</li><li>Não use outros roxos fora da escala definida</li></ul>"}]},{"id":"responsive-behavior","title":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Comportamento responsivo"}],"html":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"<p>Breakpoints: 375px, 425px, 640px, 768px, 1024px, 1280px, 1536px</p>"}]},{"id":"agent-prompt-guide","title":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"Guia de prompts para agentes"}],"html":[{"lang":"pt-BR","message":"<h3>Referência rápida de cores</h3>\n<ul><li>Marca: Kraken Purple (<code>#7132f5</code>)</li><li>Variante escura: <code>#5741d8</code></li><li>Texto: Near Black (<code>#101114</code>)</li><li>Texto secundário: <code>#9497a9</code></li><li>Fundo: White (<code>#ffffff</code>)</li></ul>\n<h3>Exemplos de prompts de componentes</h3>\n<ul><li>&quot;Crie um hero: fundo branco. Kraken-Brand 48px peso 700, letter-spacing -1px. CTA roxo (#7132f5, raio de 12px, padding de 13px 16px).&quot;</li></ul>"}]}]}